  "description": "Noire Absolu is a bold and refined masculine fragrance that blends fruity freshness with smooth leather and warm woody depth. The scent feels modern, confident, and sophisticated while maintaining a clean luxurious structure throughout the wear. The opening introduces raspberry, bergamot, and clary sage, creating a fruity aromatic freshness with a slightly sweet and herbal edge. The heart develops into cedarwood and amber, adding warmth, structure, and smooth woody richness to the composition. The base settles into leather and vetiver, leaving a smoky, earthy, and masculine trail that feels polished, long-lasting, and seductive. Noire Absolu is perfect for men who enjoy modern leather fragrances with fruity freshness and a refined woody amber dry-down.",
